# 统一换行，避免 Windows 检出把 shell 脚本 / SKILL.md 改成 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：diff 无意义，且禁止 Git 尝试做文本合并
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mkv binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

# 大文件走 Git LFS（新增素材请用：git lfs track 后提交；已入库的历史大文件不在此列，
# 迁移需单独一次 filter-repo，见 docs/素材与体积.md）
*.psd filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.blend filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.safetensors filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
